# Mutation plan for `MessagesWillBeConsumed` and `MessagesWillBeConsumedWithContext`
# (docs/PLUGIN_PLAN.md, Phase 5).
#
#   scripts/mutate-batch.sh scripts/mutations/plugin-hooks-consumed.plan
#
# The oracle is `parity::plugin_hooks::the_consumed_hooks_fire_as_go_fires_them`; the two
# `unit` lines are caught by `plugin_hooks::consumed_tests`, because no served route can write
# a burn-on-read post and the recorder answers replacements carrying only an id and a message.
# The last two lines are the no-op controls and must SURVIVE.

